# res://dialogue/chapter_launch.dialogue
# Launch monologues shown over the portal swirl, one title per chapter, plus the return
# monologue played on the way back to the hub.
# Speaker-less on purpose: conversationballoon.gd hides the nameplate entirely when
# dialogue_line.character is empty.

~ university_2
You're here now.
Swirling.
Floating.
Going back to who you once were.
What will your first memory reveal to you?
Whose face will you see first?
Will it be the face of someone you loved?
Or the face of someone you hated?
Hate...
Now, that's a strong emotion.
Let's start at the beginning.
=> END

~ return_to_hub
The memory folds shut.
It keeps what it keeps.
Back to the white room.
=> END
